{%- comment -%}
  RITUAL BUILDER — signature feature.

  Helbrede sells ingestibles AND topicals; Kapiva is ingestibles-only, so a
  cross-category routine is a shelf they structurally cannot build. Pick a
  concern, pick a depth, get a morning / day / night routine you can add whole.
{%- endcomment -%}
<nav class="wrap crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
  <a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span class="t-dim">Build your ritual</span>
</nav>

<section class="sec sec--tight" data-reveal>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="coll__head">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="sec-head__pre">build your</span>
        <h1 class="sec-head__main">Ritual</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="t-lede">
        One capsule is rarely the whole answer. Tell us what you are working on and
        we will lay out a routine across the day — something you take, something you
        apply, and the daily base underneath both — drawn from formulas that actually
        sit in the same regimen.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="rb" data-rb>
      <div class="rb__controls">
        <div class="rb__step">
          <span class="rb__lbl t-mono">1 · What are you working on</span>
          <div class="rb__chips">
            {%- for c in concerns -%}
              <button class="chip {% if forloop.first %}is-on{% endif %}" type="button"
                      data-rb-concern="{{ c.slug }}" aria-pressed="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">
                <span class="chip__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ c.label }}
              </button>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rb__step">
          <span class="rb__lbl t-mono">2 · How deep</span>
          <div class="rb__chips">
            <button class="chip" type="button" data-rb-depth="2" aria-pressed="false"><span class="chip__dot"></span>Starter · 2 products</button>
            <button class="chip is-on" type="button" data-rb-depth="3" aria-pressed="true"><span class="chip__dot"></span>Full routine · 3</button>
            <button class="chip" type="button" data-rb-depth="4" aria-pressed="false"><span class="chip__dot"></span>Complete · 4</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rb__out">
        <div class="rb__routine">
          <span class="rb__lbl t-mono">3 · Your routine</span>
          <div class="ritual" data-rb-list></div>
          <p class="t-sm t-dim-3" data-rb-note style="margin-top:.85rem"></p>
        </div>

        <aside class="panel rb__summary">
          <h2 class="pdp__block-h">Summary</h2>
          <p class="t-sm t-dim" data-rb-desc></p>
          <div class="ritual-tot">
            <span>Routine total</span>
            <strong data-rb-total>—</strong>
          </div>
          <button class="btn btn--primary btn--block btn--lg" data-rb-add>Add routine to cart</button>
          <p class="t-sm t-dim-3" style="margin-top:.8rem">
            Ayurvedic formulas are cumulative. Most of these are meant to be taken
            consistently for at least three months before you judge them.
          </p>
          <div class="note note--warn" style="margin-top:1rem">
            {% render 'icon', name: 'shield', size: 16 %}
            <span>Check each product’s safety information before combining supplements,
            especially if you take prescription medicines.</span>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% render 'catalog-json' %}
{% section 'why-helbrede' %}
